some|REVIEW: Determiner with fabric and pronoun referring back to peaches are separate source-supported proposals. Positive offers and number agreement are qualified; quantifier taxonomy and complete pragmatic coverage remain unapproved.
whether|REVIEW: The seat request is an indirect yes-no question and the Vietnamese preserves uncertainty. Infinitive guidance distinguishes whether from conditional if; broader alternative-clause coverage needs owner review.
companion|PASS: Travelling partner is the supplied person boundary, without adding a romantic relationship or handbook Sense. Quieter route and the hill setting translate faithfully; the noun remains countable.
fundamentally|PASS: Essential operational difference between machines illustrates the adverb without claiming every difference is fundamental. Vietnamese về cơ bản scopes the difference, matching the English modifier.
inclined|REVIEW: Willingness and tendency are kept within the source adjective boundary and separated from physical slope. The negative meeting example is natural; the combined boundary's breadth remains a review obligation.
